      "description": "Original and protected data are shown as labeled, distinct regions.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-demo\"><div class=\"ds-demo-heading\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3 4 6v6c0 5 8 9 8 9s8-4 8-9V6l-8-3Z\"/><path d=\"m8 12 3 3 5-6\"/></svg><strong>Del texto original al envío seguro</strong></div><div class=\"ds-original\"><span class=\"ds-label\">Tu texto original</span><p>Resume el caso de <mark>Ana Prueba</mark>.</p></div><div class=\"ds-protected\"><span class=\"ds-label\">Texto protegido para la IA</span><p>Resume el caso de <mark>[KS_…_A]</mark>.</p><span class=\"ds-explanation\">El nombre se sustituye por un código.</span></div></article>",
      "css": ".ds-demo{background:var(--paper,#fff);color:var(--ink,#102f29);border-radius:var(--radius,16px);box-shadow:var(--shadow,0 22px 60px -26px #164a373d);overflow:clip;font-family:var(--font-body,\"Manrope\",sans-serif);}.ds-demo-heading{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:20px 24px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule,#d4dfd8);font-size:14px}.ds-demo-heading svg{width:25px;height:25px;color:var(--green,#155a43);stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.6;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;flex-shrink:0}.ds-original,.ds-protected{padding:22px 24px}.ds-original{background:var(--wash,#f5f8f5);border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule,#d4dfd8)}.ds-label{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:650;margin-bottom:14px}.ds-demo p{margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.8}.ds-demo mark{padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;white-space:nowrap;background:var(--red-bg,#fbece5);color:var(--red,#8a3a2a)}.ds-protected p{font-size:23px;font-weight:550;letter-spacing:-.02em}.ds-protected mark{padding:2px 5px;background:var(--safe-bg,#d9f3e6);color:var(--safe-ink,#12523c)}.ds-explanation{display:block;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted,#4c625b);margin-top:12px}@media(max-width:520px){.ds-demo-heading{padding:18px;font-size:12px}.ds-original,.ds-protected{padding:20px 18px}.ds-original p{font-size:16px}.ds-protected p{font-size:20px}}"
